# Weekly System Implementation Walkthrough

I have completed the implementation of the `weekly_system` feature, providing a robust system for schools to manage curricula (books) and lesson plans with role-based access and editing controls.

## 🛠️ Backend Implementation

### Models & Migrations
- **[Curriculum.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Models/Curriculum.php)**: Added `edit_lock_date` to manage deadlines.
- **[CurriculumLessonPlan.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Models/CurriculumLessonPlan.php)**: Added de-normalized `curriculum_id` for efficient filtering and lock enforcement.
- **Migrations**: Updated both `curricula` and `curriculum_lesson_plans` table schemas.

### Controllers
- **[CurriculumController.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/WeeklySystem/CurriculumController.php)**: Handles book management for administrators.
- **[LessonPlanController.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/WeeklySystem/LessonPlanController.php)**: Manages lesson plans with built-in logic for:
  - **Status Locking**: Only 'Draft' plans can be edited.
  - **Date Locking**: Prevents editing after the curriculum's `edit_lock_date`.
  - **Progress Tracking**: Provides an API for admins to see who has/hasn't submitted plans.

## 🚀 Frontend & Routing

### Navigation & Layout
- **[WeeklySystemLayout.vue](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/Pages/myclass2026/Shared/WeeklySystemLayout.vue)**: A shared, role-aware layout using Quasar. It automatically displays the correct tabs for Admins vs. Teachers.
- **[pageResolver.js](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/pageResolver.js)**: Integrated all new role-based paths into the Inertia resolver.

### Admin Interfaces
- **[Index.vue (Home)](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/Pages/myclass2026/roles/school-admin/weekly_system/Index.vue)**: High-level dashboard with navigation tiles.
- **[Curriculum & Lessons Manager](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/Pages/myclass2026/roles/school-admin/weekly_system/curriculum_lessons/Index.vue)**: 
  - CRUD for book management.
  - Setting and management of `edit_lock_date`.
  - **Submission Tracker**: Live view comparing school teachers against submitted plans.

### Teacher Interface
- **[My Lesson Plans](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/Pages/myclass2026/roles/teacher/weekly_system/curriculum_lessons/Index.vue)**:
  - **Smart Filtering**: Teachers only see books matching their assigned subjects and grades (via CST).
  - **Locked Editing**: UI automatically disables edit/delete buttons if the plan status is 'Final' or if the school admin's lock date has passed.

## ✅ Verification Results
- **Backend Locks**: Verified that trying to save a plan for a locked curriculum returns a `403 Forbidden`.
- **Duplicate Prevention**: Curriculum names are checked for uniqueness within the school scope.
- **Progress Accuracy**: Admin tracker correctly identifies teachers who haven't submitted any plans for a specific book.
